# Images are binary. Without this, core.autocrlf=true and any tool that walks
# `git ls-files` treats them as text: a history rewrite's sed stripped every
# 0x0D byte and left the README images unopenable while still "looking" fine in
# a text editor. The test suite checks the PNG signature as well.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
